            "level": {
              "value": 9
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You command the attention of those around you with an elegant display. Attempt a Performance check and compare it to the Will DC of each creature in a 15-foot emanation.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is fascinated with you for as long as you perform (unless it breaks from the fascination, as normal for the condition) and is dazzled for 1 round or as long as it's fascinated, whichever is longer.\n- **Success:** The target is fascinated for 1 round and is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The target is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is unaffected."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
